\fs28 \cf0 Products Overview\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 At Cosmox Chemicals, our product portfolio is designed to meet the diverse and evolving needs of modern industries. We combine 
\f1\b high performance, reliability, and global compliance
\f0\b0  across all product lines. Our 10 advanced chemical divisions cover 
\f1\b lithium and metal additives, flame-retardant salts, organic and pharmaceutical intermediates, polymers, surfactants, battery chemicals, coatings, nutraceuticals, water treatment, and functional materials
\f0\b0 , ensuring a comprehensive offering for industrial clients worldwide.\

\f1\b Our Product Philosophy:
\f0\b0 \uc0\u8232 We deliver products that are 
\f1\b technically superior, safe, and environmentally responsible
\f0\b0 . Every product undergoes rigorous testing for purity, thermal stability, chemical performance, and industrial compatibility. Whether enhancing machinery lubrication, improving fire resistance, supporting high-performance polymers, or providing high-purity intermediates for research and production, our products are engineered for excellence.\
